TOME is an open-source project licensed under a dual-license structure to cleanly separate software implementation from game mechanics and textual content:

1. **Source Code & Software:** Licensed under the **MIT License** (see below).
2. **Game Mechanics, Spark Tables & Documentation:** Licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0)**.

